WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:02.180
Claude Sirius.

00:02.730 --> 00:04.800
Bearer of the title of 
first-class magician,

00:04.800 --> 00:07.310
of whom there are only 
ten in the world.

00:07.310 --> 00:10.650
His magic is said to be powerful 
enough to move the stars.

00:11.870 --> 00:17.190
At 17, he was the youngest professor 
ever assigned to the royal magic academy.

00:17.190 --> 00:20.140
This charismatic young man,
also known for

00:20.140 --> 00:22.900
his contributions to magic education,

00:22.900 --> 00:24.810
vanished mysteriously one day.

00:31.660 --> 00:34.870
Hey, are you serious about flying?

00:34.870 --> 00:37.420
You'll be in serious trouble 
if you fall from that height.

00:37.420 --> 00:39.200
Just watch me.

00:40.390 --> 00:42.720
Air, grant me strength.

00:42.990 --> 00:44.780
Grant me freedom.

00:44.780 --> 00:48.430
With the wind racing through the 
skies, free me from the ground.

00:49.220 --> 00:50.480
My staff,

00:53.200 --> 00:54.360
fly!

01:11.190 --> 01:13.890
See? I told you!

01:13.890 --> 01:17.900
I never get bored of watching you, Spica.

01:17.900 --> 01:19.080
Shut up, Aria.

01:19.080 --> 01:24.600
Though you do get credit for surviving 
that fall with just a bloody nose.

01:24.600 --> 01:26.600
Why not become a martial artist?

01:26.600 --> 01:28.040
Don't be stupid.

01:28.570 --> 01:32.100
I'm going to become a magician!

01:32.100 --> 01:34.010
I won't lose heart over this!

01:34.010 --> 01:35.440
Way to stay positive!

01:35.780 --> 01:41.660
I have to get into the Royal Diana 
Academy where Master Claude teaches.

01:41.660 --> 01:47.450
I'll study there and become a first-class 
magician, just like Master Claude.

01:47.450 --> 01:49.080
That's my dream!

01:50.530 --> 01:54.380
How? You can't even use a single spell.

01:55.710 --> 01:58.060
I'm still practicing!

01:58.060 --> 02:00.420
I do flight training every day.

02:00.680 --> 02:03.560
You sure do have weird 
taste, though, Spica.

02:03.560 --> 02:04.380
Huh?

02:04.380 --> 02:07.840
Most people think Claude 
is past his prime.

02:07.840 --> 02:12.450
You know, like when the cultists 
attacked Diana two years ago,

02:12.810 --> 02:16.380
and he ran off like a coward instead 
of protecting the students.

02:17.270 --> 02:18.480
Shut up.

02:18.480 --> 02:20.360
No one tells you who 
you should look up to.

02:20.360 --> 02:21.490
I hate you!

02:21.490 --> 02:22.950
Sorry.

02:22.950 --> 02:24.170
Are you angry?

02:24.170 --> 02:26.440
Go away if you're only here to mock me.

02:26.440 --> 02:28.830
I'm just worried about you.

02:28.830 --> 02:31.560
I mean, you're going to fail 
at this rate, aren't you?

02:32.330 --> 02:36.000
DISQUALIFIED

02:32.620 --> 02:35.950
You can only learn magic 
from magicians, after all.

02:35.950 --> 02:37.640
Maybe you should hire a tutor.

02:37.640 --> 02:40.410
I don't have money. 
I have too many siblings.

02:40.410 --> 02:42.630
I have to teach myself.

02:43.770 --> 02:45.590
Oh, fine.

02:45.590 --> 02:47.900
Since we're fellow Diana hopefuls,

02:47.900 --> 02:52.500
I, Aria the genius, will 
teach you Aquarius magic!

02:56.730 --> 02:58.690
Just leave it to me.

02:59.900 --> 03:02.570
You can pay me with your body.

03:03.360 --> 03:04.850
You're messing with me again.

03:06.880 --> 03:08.070
Screw Aria!

03:08.350 --> 03:10.580
I can do this on my own.

03:11.350 --> 03:13.430
Of course I can.

03:13.680 --> 03:16.620
I can. I can. I can!

03:22.850 --> 03:25.500
Mommy, I just heard a loud noise.

03:25.500 --> 03:27.720
Spica must have fallen again.

03:27.720 --> 03:30.060
Why?!

03:30.060 --> 03:32.040
You're going to fail at this rate.

03:33.650 --> 03:36.140
I know that.

03:36.140 --> 03:38.830
There's less than a year until the exam.

03:38.830 --> 03:40.870
I know I have to do something.

03:40.870 --> 03:44.580
But I don't even know anyone 
who knows any magicians.

03:44.580 --> 03:46.050
What am I supposed to do?

03:46.570 --> 03:48.180
Could you keep it down?

03:48.180 --> 03:49.910
I was enjoying my nap.

03:50.870 --> 03:54.320
Go elsewhere if you want 
to keep falling, dumb girl.

03:54.870 --> 03:56.090
No way...

03:56.090 --> 03:57.960
Is that cat talking?!

03:57.960 --> 04:01.920
Did I gain magic that 
lets me talk to animals?!

04:01.920 --> 04:03.930
You can understand me?!

04:03.920 --> 04:06.260
Wait, are you a monster cat?!

04:03.930 --> 04:06.260
EEK

04:09.210 --> 04:11.420
Sagittarius Magic.

04:17.980 --> 04:20.060
Never call me a monster cat again.

04:20.400 --> 04:23.730
I'll have you know that I was 
formerly a human magician.

04:23.730 --> 04:26.140
A magician?! A cat?!

04:26.140 --> 04:30.390
I've been cursed to take this form, 
but I can still use some magic.

04:30.750 --> 04:35.030
M-M-Master! Please let me call you Master!

04:35.030 --> 04:36.050
Wha?

04:36.050 --> 04:39.150
I don't care if you're stuck in cat form.

04:39.150 --> 04:41.590
Please teach me magic!

04:41.590 --> 04:43.880
I know I'm insulting myself here, but...

04:43.880 --> 04:45.010
Are you sane?!

04:45.010 --> 04:48.120
I want to get into Diana Academy.

04:48.730 --> 04:50.890
Do you know what you're saying?

04:51.320 --> 04:53.880
It's the highest-level 
magic academy there is.

04:53.880 --> 04:55.440
Of course I do!

04:55.440 --> 04:58.070
That's why I'm begging you!

04:57.100 --> 04:58.290
No way.

04:58.290 --> 04:59.310
Nothing in it for me.

04:59.310 --> 05:02.090
Wait! I don't have much money, 
but I'll do anything I can!

05:02.090 --> 05:03.520
Please!

05:03.980 --> 05:05.780
Anything?

05:08.480 --> 05:14.350
I-If you want me to pay with my body, 
I'll endure some embarrassment.

05:12.700 --> 05:15.460
WEARING A SWIMSUIT OR WHATEVER...

05:14.350 --> 05:15.450
No!

05:15.950 --> 05:19.610
She can talk to me, 
and she'll do anything.

05:19.610 --> 05:21.920
I have to make use of this opportunity.

05:22.150 --> 05:23.160
Okay.

05:24.280 --> 05:26.940
I can't stand by and 
watch someone struggle.

05:28.320 --> 05:29.630
Thank you!

05:29.630 --> 05:31.510
I'm Spica Virgo.

05:31.510 --> 05:32.980
Nice to meet you!

05:34.310 --> 05:37.850
Well, wanna head to the capital to train?

05:39.020 --> 05:39.960
Yes!

05:44.760 --> 05:47.860
Here we are at the capital. 
We're training here?

05:47.860 --> 05:49.460
Let's see...

05:49.780 --> 05:51.830
Raise your arm and chant the spell!

05:51.830 --> 05:54.290
Gimia Kholdbier!

05:54.290 --> 05:55.240
Right!

05:55.240 --> 05:58.210
Gimia Kholdbier!

05:58.520 --> 05:59.710
Sure thing.

06:00.000 --> 06:03.130
300 gold for a pint of beer.

06:09.280 --> 06:11.990
I haven't had beer in forever! Whoo!

06:13.160 --> 06:15.480
Hey there, ladies, wanna join us?

06:15.480 --> 06:18.240
It's a kitty! So cute!

06:20.560 --> 06:21.900
What about magic?!

06:22.850 --> 06:25.510
Are you serious about teaching me?

06:25.510 --> 06:26.820
Yes, I am.

06:26.820 --> 06:29.820
Also, I don't have money to pay 
for the beer, so that's on you!

06:29.820 --> 06:32.280
Yes, ma'am! I'll show off some tricks.

06:34.740 --> 06:39.450
When Master talked to that lady, 
she called him a "kitty."

06:39.890 --> 06:43.660
Am I really the only one 
who can hear his voice?

06:43.660 --> 06:46.200
Man, she's pretty scary.

06:46.200 --> 06:48.280
I've had enough fun with her.

06:48.280 --> 06:50.680
Maybe I'll give her an impossible 
task and make her give up.

06:50.680 --> 06:52.930
Okay, last request.

06:53.310 --> 06:57.280
Chant this before our training, 
and I'll teach you magic.

06:58.660 --> 07:00.270
The Royal Library.

07:00.660 --> 07:04.930
They have everything from picture books 
to magic tomes from across the nation.

07:05.680 --> 07:08.620
Including a legendary grimoire that 
you won't find easily elsewhere...

07:08.950 --> 07:12.110
One that grants wisdom 
to those who touch it.

07:12.490 --> 07:14.400
The Book of Providence.

07:14.400 --> 07:16.070
Pro Video Man?

07:16.070 --> 07:17.800
Yeah, Providence.

07:17.800 --> 07:19.760
The ability to see everything.

07:19.760 --> 07:21.370
You know, omniscience.

07:21.700 --> 07:25.480
I want you to use it to learn how 
to release me from this curse.

07:25.920 --> 07:27.340
That's my request.

07:27.340 --> 07:29.300
Where is it?

07:29.300 --> 07:31.540
I'm asking you because I don't know.

07:31.540 --> 07:35.220
Eh, go through all the grimoires, 
and you'll get to it eventually.

07:35.220 --> 07:37.680
Do you even know how many 
thousands of books are in here?!

07:37.680 --> 07:39.030
Let's see...

07:39.030 --> 07:40.750
I'll give you a month.

07:40.750 --> 07:42.680
You aren't even listening!

07:42.680 --> 07:45.810
Are you not going to help me?

07:45.810 --> 07:48.550
I'd love to look for it myself,

07:48.960 --> 07:52.120
but the moment any non-human 
tries to grab a book,

07:54.630 --> 07:58.990
the Mother Book overseeing the library 
detects it and sounds the alarms,

07:58.990 --> 08:00.250
and a guard shows up.

08:00.490 --> 08:03.300
You're back again?! You filthy cat!

08:03.300 --> 08:04.290
There you have it.

08:04.290 --> 08:05.350
Good luck.

08:05.350 --> 08:07.540
There's no way I can find it on my own!

08:07.540 --> 08:09.550
Forget about being my apprentice, then.

08:11.190 --> 08:13.250
Fine, I'll do it!

08:13.250 --> 08:16.970
Bring it on!

08:14.390 --> 08:16.980
Get back here, you damn cat!

08:17.390 --> 08:20.430
There's no way she'll find it in a month.

08:20.940 --> 08:24.060
Having an apprentice 
is a pain. Screw that.

08:24.060 --> 08:25.430
It's nothing personal.

08:40.010 --> 08:45.880
I read a book about transformation 
magic and got turned into a cat, too!

08:45.880 --> 08:47.140
Pfft!

08:47.140 --> 08:51.030
Watch out. Some grimoires have magic 
that activates when you open them.

08:51.030 --> 08:52.430
You could have told me!

09:01.440 --> 09:04.120
Let's learn anatomy together!

09:05.380 --> 09:08.240
G-Grimoires are so scary...

09:08.240 --> 09:10.600
That's enough for today.

09:10.600 --> 09:13.360
I doubt she'll last more than three days.

09:14.620 --> 09:16.020
However...

09:30.480 --> 09:34.500
Betraying expectations, Spica 
continued going to the library.

09:39.720 --> 09:41.250
What are you up to?

09:41.250 --> 09:43.020
Studying ancient runes.

09:43.020 --> 09:44.710
Ancient runes?

09:44.710 --> 09:46.320
What happened to looking for the book?

09:46.690 --> 09:50.950
You said the Book of Providence 
is a legendary grimoire, right?

09:50.950 --> 09:54.150
I thought it might be written 
in an ancient language.

09:54.150 --> 09:56.240
So I'm studying up.

09:56.560 --> 09:57.820
Oh?

09:57.820 --> 09:59.460
Good insight.

09:59.730 --> 10:02.320
I never expected you to be so studious.

10:02.320 --> 10:04.360
Me neither.

10:04.360 --> 10:06.710
I didn't even like reading.

10:06.710 --> 10:09.670
But the more I read, 
the more interested I got.

10:09.980 --> 10:12.280
And now I want to learn more.

10:12.620 --> 10:17.120
Ancient runes apparently get 
activated when they're carved.

10:17.810 --> 10:20.370
It looks like I underestimated you.

10:21.820 --> 10:23.700
But unfortunately...

10:24.330 --> 10:25.960
That's the closing bell.

10:25.960 --> 10:27.360
You're out of time.

10:28.360 --> 10:30.360
I gave you a month, and that was it.

10:30.360 --> 10:31.300
No way!

10:31.300 --> 10:33.410
Couldn't you give me a little more time?

10:33.810 --> 10:35.410
It won't make a difference.

10:35.890 --> 10:37.400
Please!

10:37.400 --> 10:40.020
I really want to get into Diana Academy!

10:40.360 --> 10:42.720
Why are you so fixated on Diana?

10:43.130 --> 10:45.320
What is your objective?

10:46.830 --> 10:51.410
I want to become a first-class 
magician like Master Claude.

10:51.410 --> 10:52.620
Claude...

10:53.040 --> 10:54.880
Even though people say he's a coward?

10:54.880 --> 10:57.350
I don't believe that rumor.

10:59.750 --> 11:05.060
I mean, I know how 
strong Master Claude is.

11:06.450 --> 11:12.540
Remember that incident two years ago 
when the cultists attacked Diana Academy?

11:13.310 --> 11:17.770
I happened to be at the site 
of the terror attack that day.

11:17.770 --> 11:19.650
I got caught up in it.

11:20.200 --> 11:23.120
People around me fell one after another.

11:23.120 --> 11:25.820
The screaming and wailing 
got quieter and quieter.

11:26.390 --> 11:28.380
I thought I was going to die.

11:28.380 --> 11:30.420
I wanted to see my family again.

11:30.420 --> 11:32.670
But just when I'd given up hope...

11:49.530 --> 11:50.430
Are you all right?

11:51.020 --> 11:52.570
You did well staying alive.

11:53.180 --> 11:54.860
You're strong.

11:55.260 --> 11:57.700
Master Claude protected me!

11:57.700 --> 11:59.170
He's so strong and gentle!

11:59.170 --> 12:00.910
He's such a prince!

12:00.910 --> 12:03.060
There's no way he'd run away.

12:03.370 --> 12:06.500
I want to become someone like him.

12:06.810 --> 12:11.470
A strong magician who can put my 
life on the line to protect others.

12:14.700 --> 12:16.970
What would you get out 
of protecting strangers?

12:17.830 --> 12:19.730
You really are an idiot.

12:19.730 --> 12:20.890
What?!

12:21.550 --> 12:25.000
My master's definitely 
a trash person.

12:25.000 --> 12:27.930
Maybe he should stay a cat. 
At least he's cute that way.

12:27.930 --> 12:31.790
I get what you're saying, 
but let's stop here.

12:31.790 --> 12:33.890
This is a waste of time.

12:33.890 --> 12:35.360
Both of our time.

12:35.360 --> 12:36.560
Don't say that!

12:43.540 --> 12:48.280
Is it just me, or is there 
text hidden on this cover?

12:48.280 --> 12:49.350
Text?

12:49.350 --> 12:50.210
Yes.

12:50.210 --> 12:51.700
Ancient runes.

12:51.700 --> 12:53.450
Let's see, I think it's...

12:53.450 --> 12:58.660
Laguz, ansuz, thurisaz, uruz.

12:58.660 --> 12:59.930
And it means...

13:00.300 --> 13:02.000
"The inviter."

13:10.500 --> 13:11.890
What is this?!

13:12.220 --> 13:14.100
It's a hidden passageway!

13:14.100 --> 13:15.430
Nice find!

13:15.430 --> 13:18.170
The Book of Providence must be in here!

13:18.170 --> 13:20.300
Can we go inside?

13:29.380 --> 13:31.550
It's so pretty!

13:33.200 --> 13:36.070
Someone must have used magic to 
make this extradimensional space.

13:36.070 --> 13:40.910
They must be storing forbidden books 
and national-treasure-grade grimoires.

13:41.280 --> 13:44.210
The Book of Providence is in here?

13:44.210 --> 13:45.700
There's a good chance.

13:46.190 --> 13:47.380
That is me.

13:48.690 --> 13:51.220
I am the Book of Providence.

13:51.220 --> 13:52.420
A runestone?!

13:52.420 --> 13:53.530
This is it?

13:53.530 --> 13:55.010
And it's talking!

13:55.010 --> 13:57.090
Um, er...

13:57.090 --> 14:00.650
You need not say, Spica Virgo.

14:00.950 --> 14:03.120
How do you know my name?

14:03.120 --> 14:05.420
I am all-knowing. Obviously.

14:05.420 --> 14:06.410
Yeesh.

14:06.790 --> 14:10.350
Then do you know how to 
undo this kitty's curse?

14:10.350 --> 14:11.240
Yes.

14:11.560 --> 14:14.270
He's under a karmic curse.

14:14.270 --> 14:15.460
Karmic?

14:15.460 --> 14:21.530
Unlike an ordinary transformation curse, 
it transfers the flesh to another being.

14:21.530 --> 14:23.030
A forbidden magic.

14:23.030 --> 14:26.930
Their body vanishes, 
and only their soul remains.

14:27.190 --> 14:28.380
Oh, no!

14:28.380 --> 14:29.920
How do we get him back?

14:29.920 --> 14:31.510
There's just one way.

14:32.140 --> 14:36.000
Use the Rebirth Magic that you possess.

14:37.970 --> 14:40.180
Huh? Me?

14:40.710 --> 14:45.020
Have you never noticed that your 
wounds heal rather quickly?

14:46.370 --> 14:50.020
Though you do get credit for surviving 
that fall with just a bloody nose.

14:51.580 --> 14:56.650
You've merely failed to realize 
that you command special magic.

14:56.940 --> 14:58.880
Did you hear that, Master?!

14:58.880 --> 15:01.010
There's no way it's that easy!

15:01.010 --> 15:04.090
I'm a proper magician now!

15:01.330 --> 15:04.090
She did hear my voice, though.

15:04.090 --> 15:07.260
I'm gonna be a first-class 
magician like Master Claude!

15:04.090 --> 15:07.250
It's too much to be mere coincidence.

15:07.250 --> 15:09.320
This is an opportunity.

15:09.320 --> 15:11.570
I can finally be free of my curse!

15:11.960 --> 15:14.870
Hey, so how do I undo the curse, exactly?

15:14.870 --> 15:18.940
You must inject your magic into him.

15:19.180 --> 15:20.650
Inject it?

15:21.500 --> 15:22.660
Kiss him.

15:23.640 --> 15:25.850
Wait, are you serious about this?

15:25.850 --> 15:29.010
I mean, I'm a girl coming of age!

15:29.010 --> 15:30.090
Don't be stupid!

15:30.090 --> 15:32.120
Just pretend you're giving CPR!

15:32.120 --> 15:34.220
But it's my first kiss!

15:32.120 --> 15:34.220
I'm not even human right now!

15:34.220 --> 15:36.950
Sure, it's like a romantic 
fairy tale, but...

15:34.220 --> 15:35.210
I'm a cat!

15:35.210 --> 15:36.960
It's Cat PR!

15:36.950 --> 15:40.170
I can't kiss someone who 
isn't my lover on the lips!

15:40.170 --> 15:42.540
Who said anything about 
kissing him on the lips?

15:44.250 --> 15:46.140
You kiss him...

15:47.830 --> 15:49.780
on the anus.

15:52.590 --> 15:55.050
What the heck?! Why?!

15:55.050 --> 15:57.450
Why?!

15:55.050 --> 15:56.960
Yeah, nah...

15:56.960 --> 15:58.270
I'll pass on that, too.

15:58.270 --> 15:59.260
Right?!

15:59.260 --> 16:02.080
By injecting your magic through his anus,

16:02.080 --> 16:04.780
you ensure that it is absorbed 
quickly and circulates effectively

16:04.780 --> 16:06.440
and immediately through his body.

16:06.440 --> 16:07.720
What is this, a suppository?!

16:07.720 --> 16:11.530
There's no way I'm letting my 
first kiss be with a butthole!

16:11.530 --> 16:14.050
Quit shouting "butthole" like that!

16:14.050 --> 16:16.030
There has to be another way...

16:18.000 --> 16:19.090
Who's there?

16:20.510 --> 16:22.620
That smells like the guard.

16:23.710 --> 16:26.230
I-I'm sorry for trespassing!

16:27.940 --> 16:29.910
Run...

16:29.910 --> 16:32.420
The library...

16:32.880 --> 16:35.120
is under attack!

16:47.470 --> 16:48.870
An Orthrus.

16:48.870 --> 16:51.200
One of the mystical beasts 
that the cultists use.

16:51.200 --> 16:55.110
I heard the cultists were suppressed 
by the military after that incident.

16:55.110 --> 16:57.480
Must be a band of stragglers.

16:57.480 --> 16:58.860
This is bad!

16:58.860 --> 17:00.790
They must be after the forbidden books!

17:00.790 --> 17:02.500
What should we do?

17:02.500 --> 17:05.050
The army must be on their 
way from the royal capital.

17:05.050 --> 17:07.550
We'll just have to keep 
running until they arrive.

17:13.890 --> 17:15.430
Let go!

17:14.600 --> 17:16.350
Hot!

17:20.010 --> 17:22.080
I don't think we can lose it.

17:22.080 --> 17:23.300
All right.

17:23.300 --> 17:24.800
We'll have to bait it out.

17:25.260 --> 17:27.980
You take care of things 
here. I'll go ahead!

17:27.980 --> 17:30.390
Doesn't that line usually 
go the other way?!

17:30.390 --> 17:33.760
But I'm just a weak 
little kitty right now.

17:33.760 --> 17:36.600
And I'm just a weak little girl!

17:36.600 --> 17:38.710
There's only one other way.

17:38.710 --> 17:42.040
Once I'm human, I'll have orders 
of magnitude more magic power.

17:42.450 --> 17:43.740
Undo my curse.

17:45.690 --> 17:48.310
Anything but that!

17:48.310 --> 17:49.670
We're about to die here!

17:50.490 --> 17:53.190
But you're human inside, aren't you?

17:53.190 --> 17:55.020
That spells death for my maidenly virtue!

17:55.020 --> 17:56.600
Better than actual, physical death!

17:56.600 --> 17:58.630
I'd rather die!

18:00.960 --> 18:02.410
Okay, fine.

18:04.030 --> 18:06.430
I guess that's the extent 
of your determination.

18:07.930 --> 18:10.740
My determination...

18:11.670 --> 18:14.480
All that talk about doing 
anything was just talk.

18:14.800 --> 18:16.380
Consider our agreement over.

18:16.850 --> 18:18.150
Master!

18:18.150 --> 18:18.950
Wait—

18:28.210 --> 18:30.290
I'm dead.

18:31.000 --> 18:35.340
I shouldn't have said I'd rather die.

18:41.910 --> 18:45.220
Sagittarius Magic: Whirlwind!

18:46.930 --> 18:48.060
Master!

18:48.060 --> 18:49.800
Hurry up and get out of here!

18:53.410 --> 18:54.560
Damn it.

18:54.560 --> 18:56.260
What a pain of an apprentice.

18:56.260 --> 18:59.230
Master!

19:01.750 --> 19:03.270
Why?

19:04.580 --> 19:08.330
I should have known there was 
no way I could protect people.

19:08.330 --> 19:11.710
I'm being rescued again.

19:13.060 --> 19:14.710
But I made up my mind...

19:16.230 --> 19:19.090
that I'd become a strong magician!

19:32.060 --> 19:33.770
I'm still inexperienced.

19:34.220 --> 19:37.220
There's no way I can defeat that thing.

19:37.610 --> 19:40.140
But I'll do everything I can right now.

19:55.840 --> 19:58.590
Who do you think you're 
barking at, you dumb mutt?

20:02.290 --> 20:04.330
Ah, excellent.

20:04.330 --> 20:06.260
I haven't had my body for two years.

20:06.550 --> 20:08.860
M-Master Claude?!

20:11.410 --> 20:13.360
Do you want a treat?

20:13.360 --> 20:17.150
How about you do a trick for me first?

20:19.270 --> 20:21.510
Sagittarius Grand Magic...

20:24.340 --> 20:27.310
Cryo Bow: Icing Arrow!

20:28.750 --> 20:29.820
Down, boy.

20:39.870 --> 20:42.820
And stay down, pup.

20:46.430 --> 20:48.690
I don't sense any magic anymore.

20:49.190 --> 20:50.880
The cultists must have left.

20:50.880 --> 20:52.390
Wow...

20:52.390 --> 20:54.850
This is Master Claude's magic?

20:54.850 --> 20:57.860
I can't believe you were Master Claude!

20:57.860 --> 20:59.320
You never noticed?

20:59.790 --> 21:01.330
Well...

21:01.330 --> 21:05.140
I never would have thought 
you'd be such an asshole!

21:04.370 --> 21:05.570
Hey...

21:05.570 --> 21:08.140
Was all that kindness two 
years ago just an illusion?!

21:08.140 --> 21:09.380
Wait!

21:09.380 --> 21:10.070
I just...

21:10.070 --> 21:12.640
Master Claude's b-butt...

21:12.640 --> 21:16.220
Please don't be disappointed 
by an idealized version of me.

21:13.040 --> 21:14.490
Ow...

21:16.220 --> 21:17.660
I am who I am.

21:17.660 --> 21:19.820
I'mfh sohhfwhy.

21:20.360 --> 21:22.080
You're not kind at all!

21:22.880 --> 21:24.040
But...

21:24.700 --> 21:27.480
the way he looked just now...

21:28.540 --> 21:30.710
was the same as back then.

21:31.310 --> 21:35.450
Guess I don't need you anymore, 
now that I'm back in my own body.

21:36.040 --> 21:38.070
And that's it for our agreement, too.

21:36.360 --> 21:38.070
Hey, wait!

21:38.070 --> 21:39.190
Bye-bye.

21:38.070 --> 21:40.020
Teach me magic!

21:43.450 --> 21:45.880
Wait, you're a cat again!

21:45.880 --> 21:47.140
Why?!

21:50.240 --> 21:53.390
Well, you did say you 
didn't need me anymore.

21:53.390 --> 21:54.950
Bye-bye.

21:53.390 --> 21:56.070
W-Wait, please!

21:56.070 --> 21:59.450
We're bound by fate now, aren't we?

21:59.450 --> 22:01.460
Want me to pull that tongue 
out of your mouth?!

22:01.460 --> 22:02.120
Teehee!

22:04.660 --> 22:07.790
Hey, Providence! 
This isn't what you said would happen!

22:07.790 --> 22:11.310
She simply isn't of high enough level.

22:11.820 --> 22:15.920
Unless she and the accursed 
are of equal level,

22:15.920 --> 22:18.820
the curse cannot be fully undone.

22:19.260 --> 22:20.510
Which means...

22:20.790 --> 22:26.050
I need to train Spica into becoming 
a first-class magician like me.

22:26.050 --> 22:29.150
Make me a first-class magician?

22:29.930 --> 22:32.550
It seems our interests align.

22:33.380 --> 22:36.760
How? You can't even use a single spell.

22:37.980 --> 22:40.970
Can I really become one?

22:40.970 --> 22:43.540
You will. I'll make you into one.

22:43.950 --> 22:46.280
That's the least you can do for me.

22:48.710 --> 22:50.640
Call me Professor from now on.

22:50.640 --> 22:52.050
Professor?

22:52.050 --> 22:54.810
I was a professor at Diana, after all.

22:54.810 --> 22:57.510
I'll talk to the headmistress 
and get my job back.

22:57.860 --> 22:59.980
I'll be your teacher.

22:59.980 --> 23:02.100
You'd better be ready for 
the next three years.

23:03.560 --> 23:06.440
Master Claude's going to be my teacher?!

23:06.440 --> 23:07.940
One-on-one training?!

23:07.940 --> 23:10.290
Am I dreaming?!

23:10.720 --> 23:14.500
But Claude wasn't ready 
for what was to come.

23:15.610 --> 23:19.820
He had no idea that he would be in charge 
of a class full of problem students

23:19.820 --> 23:22.810
known to Diana as "Pandora's Box."

23:25.340 --> 23:28.620
I spent every day preparing for the 
Royal Diana Academy entrance exam,

23:28.620 --> 23:31.520
braving rain and wind, taking 
care of my family's oranges!

23:31.520 --> 23:34.910
But it all paid off, and the 
oranges turned out delicious!

23:34.910 --> 23:37.290
Wait, what does this have 
to do with the exam?

23:36.850 --> 23:39.960
EPISODE 2: MAGIC OF THE ZODIAC

23:37.290 --> 23:39.760
Next episode: "Magic of the Zodiac."
